For (3), you absolutely have to do this for Stan.

I really don't like that we've shot Stan in the foot by
going with Andrew's now default non-centered parameterization
and I don't think we should shoot ourselves in the other foot
by writing sub-optimal Stan code.

- Bob

> On Nov 2, 2015, at 5:56 PM, Andrew Gelman <gel...@stat.columbia.edu> wrote:
