Hi Andre,

Interesting question. Your re-parameterisation idea scales all variables equally, and the making the variances to match doesn't necessarily make the sampling more efficient as the tail behavior also changes, The next step would be to take into account also the change in the tail shape by using a transformation which maps the values from normal(0,1) to student_t(nu,mu,sigma).

Aki

