Aside from the geometric considerations of parameterization,
make sure you have a constraint

  real<lower=2> nu;

because the rescaling assumes n >= 2.

And you have to be careful to convert sigma back to the original
scale if you need to make external comparisons.

We're going to have to start a parameterization page to go
along with our priors page.  We could eventually start building
in some of these parameterizations directly.

- Bob

