Message-ID: <pA_OLbp9vTo.mD2xG2F2BAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <pA_OLbp9vTo.0JtmIiB0BAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <pA_OLbp9vTo.0JtmIiB0BAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/pA_OLbp9vTo/m/mD2xG2F2BAAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
