From ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com  Wed Nov 11 08:45:33 2015
From: ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com (Michael Betancourt)
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2015 08:45:33 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] How to implement sum of N pareto distributions where N is poisson distributed and its approximation
Message-ID: <yRpTjxhY5UM.XMBGngdDBQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <yRpTjxhY5UM.uapgLVkwBQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
