None of these changes are R specific.  You could
create an issue in stan-dev/math for the function, then
it could be run through Stan itself in stan-dev/stan.
There's nothing to change in RStan itself.

But really we need to get Stan to 64-bits.  Then we won't
have trouble until that mean gets near 2^60 (roughly 10^18).

- Bob

