    y_hat[i] <- b1*u1[i] + b2*u2[i] + b3*inter[i] + a1[subject[i]] + a2[gender[i]];

This does an elementwise product:

> inter <-u1.*u2;

Stan saves only parameters, transformed parameters, and
generated quantities.  With RStan you can select a subset of
those to save.

