The inverse gamma prior — it’s all kinds of trouble.

On Nov 30, 2015, at 8:54 PM, michael burgess <jmichae...@gmail.com> wrote:

> Ok, I'll put together the list of papers and the relevant code from JAGs shortly. But "fat gamma priors"? I'm not sure I understand.
